development.question_text:
The bar represents $100$ equal parts. Each of its four sections contains $25$ parts.
What percentage is shaded?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.75]
\fill[gray!40] (0,0) rectangle (3,1);
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4,1);
\foreach \x in {1,2,3} {\draw (\x,0)--(\x,1);}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
